OL,3,GNEWSAHousehold recycling centre reopens
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA household recycling centre in a city
OL,7,Fhas now reopened following a fire.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it was called to the site in
OL,11,FFengate, Peterborough, at about 10:30
OL,12,FBST on Saturday and firefighters put
OL,13,Fout the blaze in a skip, with the cause
OL,14,Fbelieved to have been "accidental".
OL,16,FPeterborough City Council said a
OL,17,Fslimmed down service had resumed on
OL,18,FSunday after the fire had forced the
OL,19,Fsite to close.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
