OL,3,GNEWSAHousehold recycling centre reopens
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn its latest social media post, the
OL,7,Fcouncil said the centre was
OL,8,F"temporarily unable to accept small
OL,9,Felectrical appliances" and visitors
OL,10,Fwere urged to only attend if "strictly
OL,11,Fnecessary" during the disruption.
